%% Mira template: Mermaid sequence diagram
%% Use when the paper needs to show interaction order, call chain,
%% human-decision gates, feedback control, solver invocation, or data-service flow.

sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Actor A
    participant B as Actor B
    participant C as Actor C

    A->>B: Request / input
    activate B
    B->>C: Query / compute
    activate C
    C-->>B: Response / result
    deactivate C
    B-->>A: Decision / output
    deactivate B

    Note over A,B: External or human-facing interaction
    Note over B,C: Internal computation or data path

